			],
			"color":"#432",
			"widgets_values":[
				"fp8_fast seems to cause huge quality degradation\n\nfp_16_fast enables \"Full FP16 Accmumulation in FP16 GEMMs\" feature available in the very latest pytorch nightly, this is around 20% speed boost. \n\nSageattn if you have it installed can be used for almost double inference speed\n\nhttps://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/blob/main/Wan2_1-I2V-14B-720P_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors\n\n\nfp8_fast 似乎会导致 严重的画质下降。\n\nfp_16_fast 会启用 PyTorch 最新 Nightly 版本中提供的 “在 FP16 GEMM 中进行全 FP16 累加” 的功能，能够带来约 20% 的速度提升。(无法运行)\n\n如果你安装了 SageAttn，也可以启用它，推理速度几乎能提升一倍。\n（叠加Triton+SageAttn 实测快了25%~30%）"
			],
